WEBVTT

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:07.190
Hey, buddy.

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:08.590
Hey, Buzz.

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:10.310
You doing okay?

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:11.470
I don't know, Buzz.

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:14.870
I know you weren't around
when Andy was little...

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:17.630
but I don't remember it
being this hard.

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:19.230
(BONNIE SNORING)

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:20.710
Want me to take
the next watch?

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:21.830
I'll keep an eye on Forky.

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:23.990
No, no. I need to do this.

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:25.310
That little voice inside me

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:27.510
would never leave me alone
if I gave up.

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:28.990
BUZZ: Huh.

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:31.590
Who do you think it is?

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:32.790
Who?

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:35.510
The voice inside of you.
Who do you think it is?

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:37.430
Uh...

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:38.750
Me.

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:40.190
You know, my conscience?

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:45.270
That part of you
that tells you things?

00:00:45.430 --> 00:00:46.550
What you're really thinking?

00:00:48.070 --> 00:00:49.350
Fascinating.

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:52.230
So, your inner voice
advises you.

00:00:52.390 --> 00:00:53.390
What?

00:00:55.310 --> 00:00:57.310
VOICE BOX: It's a secret
mission in uncharted space.

00:00:57.430 --> 00:00:58.310
Let's go.

00:01:00.110 --> 00:01:01.670
(SNORING)

00:01:02.110 --> 00:01:03.110
Where's Forky?

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:06.030
Oh, no!
Forky!

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:08.070
Forky!

00:01:08.470 --> 00:01:09.710
I am not a toy!

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:10.950
I'm a spork.

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:12.030
(WHISPERING) Be quiet!

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:13.550
I was made for soup, salad...

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:15.710
maybe chili,
and then the trash.

00:01:15.870 --> 00:01:17.150
(LAUGHS) I'm litter!

00:01:17.230 --> 00:01:18.230
Freedom!

00:01:18.430 --> 00:01:19.870
(GASPING)

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:21.070
(WHIMPERS)

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:22.750
Hamm, how far
to our next stop?

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:24.550
5.32 miles, give or take.

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:25.750
I can make that.

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:27.190
I'll meet you at the RV park.

00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:29.190
Woody, hold on a minute.
Woody!

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:35.990
(SCREAMING)

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:37.350
(GROANING)

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:41.990
(GRUNTS)

00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:43.470
(PANTING)

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:45.950
(EXHALES)

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:48.950
Forky!

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:52.550
Forky, where are you?

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:54.150
Forky!

00:01:54.310 --> 00:01:55.670
Forky, where are you?

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:57.270
(MUFFLED GRUNTING)

00:01:59.230 --> 00:02:00.230
(SIGHS)

00:02:13.830 --> 00:02:15.550
-Carry me?
-No.

00:02:16.350 --> 00:02:17.990
Why do I have to be a toy?

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:19.190
Because you have Bonnie's name

00:02:19.270 --> 00:02:20.790
written on the bottom
of your sticks.

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:22.030
Why do I have Bonnie's name

00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:23.670
written on the bottom
of my sticks?

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:25.110
Because she... (SIGHS)

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:30.430
Look, she plays with you
all the time, right?

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:31.830
Ugh. Yes.

00:02:31.990 --> 00:02:33.830
And who does she sleep with
every night?

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:35.230
The big white fluffy thing?

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:36.710
No, not her pillow.

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:38.110
You.

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:40.070
-(GROANS)
-All right, Forky.

00:02:40.230 --> 00:02:43.750
You have to understand
how lucky you are right now.

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:45.070
You're Bonnie's toy.

00:02:45.270 --> 00:02:47.470
You are going to help create
happy memories...

00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:49.670
that will last
for the rest of her life.

00:02:50.910 --> 00:02:51.990
Huh? What?

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:53.310
(EXCLAIMS ANGRILY)

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:56.310
(GRUNTS) Okay.
Doing it for Bonnie.

00:02:56.470 --> 00:02:58.470
Doing this for Bonnie,
you're doing it for Bonnie.

00:02:58.630 --> 00:03:01.790
Okay, like it or not,
you are a toy.

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:03.470
Maybe you don't like
being one,

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:04.790
but you are one nonetheless.

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:06.070
Which means you are going

00:03:06.150 --> 00:03:07.310
to be there for Andy
when he...

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:08.710
Who's Andy?

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:10.630
I mean, Bonnie.

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:12.350
You have to be there
for Bonnie.

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:14.190
That is your job.

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:15.670
Well, what's your job?

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:17.990
Well, right now, it's to make
sure you do yours.

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:19.750
-Carry me?
-No!

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:26.990
Who's Andy?

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:30.710
Andy was my other kid.

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:33.110
You had another kid?

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:34.270
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:35.950
For a long time.

00:03:37.470 --> 00:03:39.190
And it was pretty great.

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:42.230
I was a favorite toy,
actually.

00:03:43.470 --> 00:03:45.550
Running the room was my job.

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:47.110
Keeping all the toys
in place...

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:49.990
FORKY: So, he thought
Andy's room was a planet?

00:03:50.150 --> 00:03:51.870
(CHUCKLES) Wow,
that is messed up.

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:52.950
WOODY: Right!

00:03:53.030 --> 00:03:54.670
That's exactly what I thought
when he first showed up.

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:56.950
FORKY: (LAUGHS) Yeah. I mean,
how is that not annoying?

00:03:57.110 --> 00:03:59.270
-Thank you!
-Seriously, that is the...

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:01.190
Well, then you
watch 'em grow up

00:04:01.270 --> 00:04:03.070
and become a full person.

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:06.630
And then they leave.

00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:09.030
They go off and do things
you'll never see.

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:14.030
Don't get me wrong,
you still feel good about it.

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:15.870
But then somehow
you find yourself,

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:17.110
after all those years...

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:20.150
sitting in a closet
just feeling...

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:21.270
Useless?

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:24.350
Yeah.

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:26.390
Your purpose fulfilled?

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:28.590
Exactly.

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:30.350
Woody, I know
what your problem is.

00:04:30.430 --> 00:04:31.430
You do?

00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:32.990
You're just like me.

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:34.190
Trash!

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:35.950
What is it with you and trash?

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:37.510
-It's warm.
-Ew.

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:38.950
-It's cozy.
-I guess.

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:40.110
And safe!

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:41.870
Like somebody's
whispering in your ear,

00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:43.430
"Everything's gonna be okay."

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:45.830
Forky, that's it.

00:04:45.990 --> 00:04:48.710
That's how Bonnie feels
when she's with you.

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:50.470
-She does?
-Yes!

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:53.870
Wait a sec.

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:57.110
-You mean she thinks I'm warm?
-Yep.

00:04:57.270 --> 00:04:58.350
-And cozy?
-Uh-huh.

00:04:58.510 --> 00:04:59.790
And sometimes kinda squishy?

00:04:59.950 --> 00:05:01.230
Well, that, too. Yes.

00:05:01.390 --> 00:05:02.870
(GASPS) I get it now.

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:04.150
I'm Bonnie's trash.

00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:05.350
Yes! Wait, what?

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:06.630
I am Bonnie's trash!

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:07.830
No, no, no, not exactly.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:09.230
She must be feeling awful
without me.

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:10.550
Woody, we got to get going,
she needs me!

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:12.510
-Yeah... Whoa, whoa.
-Hey, Bonnie, I'm coming!

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:13.830
Forky, slow down! Forky!

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:15.310
FORKY: Bonnie, I'm coming!

00:05:15.470 --> 00:05:16.470
WOODY: Forky!

